  "title": "Upwork to Report Second Quarter Financial Results on August 10, 2026",
  "summary": "PALO ALTO, Calif., July 21, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Upwork Inc. (Nasdaq: UPWK), the world’s human and AI-powered work marketplace, today announced that it will report its financial results for the second quarter of 2026 on Monday, August 10, 2026 after market close.",
